SUMMARY:Take-Two Interactive: Fiscal 2027 results and first fiscal 2028 gui
 dance (date to confirm)
DESCRIPTION:Date not confirmed. The report says: Mid to late May 2027.\nWHA
 T TO CHECK\nIs fiscal 2028 guided above fiscal 2027? That is the test for 
 a post-launch slump.\n\nWHERE THE REPORT STOOD (11 Oct 2026)\nVerdict: Wai
 t · buy < $126\nPrice then $213 · bear $82.6 · base $168 · bull $262\n
 Margin of safety below $126\n\nIF YOU HOLD IT\nHold\, but keep the positio
 n small enough that a 40% fall would not hurt\, and do not add before the 
 launch. The price already assumes a record launch\, so the reward for bein
 g right is small next to the cost of being wrong.\n\nSIGNALS TO ADD\n• P
 rice below about $168 with the launch delivered\n• The online mode launc
 hes and recurrent spending grows above the fiscal 2026 level of $5.2bn\n
 • First fiscal 2028 guidance above fiscal 2027\n• Net cash reached and
  share buybacks restarted\n• Insiders buying shares\n\nSIGNALS TO SELL\n
 • A third delay of GTA VI\n• The online mode slips past fiscal 2028 or
  earns less than GTA Online does now\n• Fiscal 2028 guidance below fisca
 l 2027\n• A large acquisition paid for with new shares\n• Price above 
 about $262 (the bull value) without higher earnings estimates\n\nAFTERWARD
